; Meadow — the ground eirune lands on, and the first authored sheet in the
; project: 32 px tiles on a tight grid, no gutter, ten columns.
;
; Ids are Pixelorama's own, preserved by tools/Export-TilesetSheet.ps1, so the
; tile numbered 1 in art/source/terrain/eirune_ground.pxo is the tile numbered 1
; here. 1-3 are the grass fills and 29 the trodden dirt; the rest of the sheet
; is edge pieces and plants, which GroundAtlasTests rejects here on sight —
; edges carry a corner of the neighbouring material and plants carry
; transparency, and neither survives being repeated across a floor.
